{
  "version": 1,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 720,
      "text": "05 · How we measure it"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 1400,
      "h": 720,
      "text": "04 · My work"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 860,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "03 · The product"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · Why it happens"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · Problem"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Hiring couldn't keep up"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "ByteDance's hiring fell short in two ways. (TA: talent-acquisition partner, the recruiter running a search.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Not fast enough**\nToo little concurrency; candidates move through the pipeline too slowly."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Not good enough**\nThe quality of a hire leans on the individual TA's skill."
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Hiring is matching, and the TA carries both sides"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Does this candidate fit this role? Answering it well takes two things."
    },
    {
      "id": "m",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 246,
      "w": 150,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**Candidate × role**\nDo they fit?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sup",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Supply**\nEnough candidates, with fresh information"
    },
    {
      "id": "und",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Role understanding**\nWho does this role really need?"
    },
    {
      "id": "bn1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 928,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 244,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "TAs dig the talent pool by hand, across many roles at once.\n\n**→ The efficiency bottleneck**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bn2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 928,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 244,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "Rests on each TA's own grasp of the business.\n\n**→ Quality varies by person**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "A recruiting workbench for TAs"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Primary users: TAs and sourcers. Secondary users: hiring managers."
    },
    {
      "id": "inf",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "rect",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Infrastructure**\nBet 1: make the TA's daily toolkit a platform"
    },
    {
      "id": "sp",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Supply**\n- **Sourcing:** careers site, referrals, internal transfers, external channels\n- **Activation:** refresh intent, new projects and roles"
    },
    {
      "id": "dw",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1824,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 268,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**The rest of the day**\n- Funnel analytics per role\n- Hiring brief with the HM\n- Interview scheduling"
    },
    {
      "id": "ah",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "rect",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Agentic Hiring**\nBet 2: read the role right, recommend right"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**Clarify**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1615,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**Recall**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1742,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**Evaluate**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1869,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**Rank**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1996,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**HM review**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ahn",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 418,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "A TA or sourcer hands over the role; the agent clarifies it, then recalls, evaluates and ranks."
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Two things I owned"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A: recommendation quality, fixed through bad-case attribution.   B: product experience, iterated from user feedback."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · Recommendation quality**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bad",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 124,
      "text": "**Bad case**\nfrom live data: recommended by the agent, rejected by the hiring manager"
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "diamond",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "Why was the role misread?"
    },
    {
      "id": "k1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**1 · Clear need, misread by the AI**\nAn AI product-manager role surfaced people with algorithm backgrounds: a different job."
    },
    {
      "id": "k2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "**2 · The user didn't say it clearly**\nThe requirement is vague, or incomplete."
    },
    {
      "id": "k3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1016,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "**3 · The user's own bar is unclear**"
    },
    {
      "id": "x1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Job taxonomy**\n- Level 1: job family. Level 2: what the role actually does.\n- Tags live roles and candidates for recall.\n- Written into the ranking stage's system prompt."
    },
    {
      "id": "x2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "**Ask, don't guess**\n- Vague: the agent checks itself and flags it back.\n- Incomplete: it asks follow-ups from a full checklist."
    },
    {
      "id": "x3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1016,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "**Long-term preference memory**\nDistill the bar from the user's past behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": "res",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**21% → 25%**\npass rate in an A/B test, staged rollout: +4 points"
    },
    {
      "id": "ux",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1128,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · Product experience**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1164,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 76,
      "text": "**User feedback**\nfrom TAs and sourcers"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1158,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 88,
      "text": "**Users didn't know how to describe a role to the agent**"
    },
    {
      "id": "x4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1158,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 88,
      "text": "**Preset prompts**\nStart from a ready-made draft and edit it, not from a blank box."
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Right, and complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Two numbers say whether the work is paying off."
    },
    {
      "id": "acc",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 734,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Accuracy**\nAre the picks right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Hiring managers' résumé-review pass rate**\npassed review ÷ recommended by the agent\n- Benchmark: human TAs\n- Goal: approach the best TA"
    },
    {
      "id": "cov",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 954,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Coverage**\nAre any missing?"
    },
    {
      "id": "cov2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 934,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Who did the agent miss?**\nFor the same role: candidates a TA recommended who passed review, but the agent never surfaced."
    }
  ],
